  "details": "1. Have a another player step around/inside of a pickup\n\n2. Walk closer towards this player\n\n2. The \"Laser User Selection\" will prevent us from grabbing the pickup, raycasting onto the player's pill instead. Making it impossible to pickup the pickup until we step further away or the other player distances themselves from the pickup.\n\nNote: This was not tested outside of Build & Test. But I am assuming it works the same outside of it.",
